  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation achieve 0.65 accuracy. Testing image-only models (config_010) isolates the modality's impact, comparing image data's potential to RNA. This clarifies whether image-only approaches can match RNA's performance, addressing a key uncertainty about modality importance. It balances exploration (testing new modalities) with exploitation (building on RNA's proven effectiveness)."
